The Caine Mutiny Court-Martial is a 2023 American legal drama
television film written and directed by William Friedkin.

12
01:12:40,000 --> 01:12:46,000
It is based on Herman Wouk's 1953 play of the same name, itself
based on Wouk's 1951 novel The Caine Mutiny.

13
